Resource monitor Rust dependencies

Dependencies locked in native/resource-monitor/Cargo.lock, including platform-specific and build-time crates.
Distributed under the MIT option where multiple licenses are offered; unicode-ident also requires Unicode-3.0.
License and notice texts are reproduced below. Identical texts are shared across the listed crates.

